---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-[#14110E] text-white/80">
  <div class="container-page py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-brand-500)] text-white">
          {/* TODO: MENTOR CEAM logo asset pending */}
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6 4v6a5 5 0 0 0 10 0V4" />
            <circle cx="18.5" cy="14.5" r="3" />
            <path d="M11 14v3a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 11 0v-2" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-white text-[15px] tracking-tight">
          MENTOR CEAM
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-white/60">
        Un proyecto de <span class="text-white/85 font-semibold">Curso VIP CEAM</span> · La Paz, Bolivia
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/55 max-w-2xl">
      Herramienta educativa: no reemplaza el criterio clínico ni la evaluación médica directa.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-white/45">
      © {year} MENTOR CEAM. Todos los derechos reservados.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
